# card-sheet-tool (read-only reference)

`card-sheet-tool` is **not** part of this repo. It is added to the workspace for reference only.

- **Never modify** any file under `card-sheet-tool/` (including when it lives at `~/Downloads/projects/battle/card-sheet-tool`).
- **Do not** refactor, fix, or “clean up” that project unless the user explicitly revokes this rule.
- **Read and cite** it when implementing Void Matter game logic (especially combat).

